(text "DFFRN_J2N16X7: DFF_J2N16 (falling edge of C) with an asynchronous clear (Q = 0) while RN = 0. 8 tubes: DFF_J2N16 + one 6Kh7B.\nRN is the reset line, not an LV net: it idles at -20 V (RN = 1) and is pulled to GND (RN = 0) by a relay contact.\nEach diode of the 6Kh7B goes from RN (anode) into FQN of one latch, the grid of the cross-coupled triode on plate\nQ: the line at GND turns that triode on whatever C and D do (both latches, so every release is clean).\nCc 2.7 pF across each feedback divider compensates the diode's A-K capacitance (<= 5.8 pF) on FQN.\nDelays, limits and power: the cell page (plate chokes since TRS v0.58).\nHeater 6.3 V: 2.0 A + 0.3 A. Page: sch/logic/DFFRN_J2N16X7/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3e28e14d-b72c-46a9-8ac8-e0420862e877"))

(embedded_fonts no))
